  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy CGIAR Initiatives 2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultst&#xf6;d CGIAR Initiatives 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During 2021 CGIAR developed a new research portfolio with 31 Research Initiative within three science groups Systems Transformation, Reslilient Agrofood systems and Genetic Innovation. The Initiative were assessed scientifically by Independent Science and Development Council that works on behalf of the donor group. Sida  called off consultants to do an assessment based on Sida&apos;s five perspectives.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under 2021 tog CGIAR fram en ny forskningsportf&#xf6;lj om 31 forskningsinitiativ inom tre forskningsomr&#xe5;den, Systemomvandling, Resilienta agro-matsystem, samt Genetiska innovationer, och bed&#xf6;mdes vetenskapligt att Independent Science and Development Council som arbetar p&#xe5; uppdrag av givargruppen. Sida gav i uppdrag &#xe5;t konsulter att bed&#xf6;mma forskningsinitiativen utifr&#xe5;n Sidas fem perspektiv.</narrative>
  </description>
